From 922c7ab3f7ad8d7283d876817c053acce4b25ada Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: arena-ai-coding-agent <arena-ai-coding-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 07:10:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Extend product patch with build/regression coverage

The settings-document API added in the patch makes readDocument/writeDocument
required on SettingsApi, but two host test fixtures in apiproxy still omitted
them, so the shipped patch did not type-check. Add those fixture stubs and a
focused subagent route-inheritance regression test.
---
 patches/open-authority-web-only.patch | 81 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 81 insertions(+)

